# SYMONE API rules for Cursor

See AGENTS.md at the repository root.

API base: https://symone.fr/api-proxy/v1 (sandbox: https://symone.fr/api-proxy/v1/sandbox). No authentication.
Trip search: GET /route/ai/search?depart=&arrival=&date_from=YYYY-MM-DD&date_to=YYYY-MM-DD&limit=&cursor=
Nearby cities: GET /route/cities-near?location=
Errors: JSON {"error": "message"}; on 429 wait Retry-After and retry once.
MCP: https://symone.fr/mcp (trips), https://symone.fr/docs/mcp (docs).
The API is read-only: booking only on https://symone.fr/moto.

Docs: https://symone.fr/developers - OpenAPI: https://symone.fr/openapi.json
